    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>「悔棋（撤销整轮）」会循环撤销，一直退到我方上一次落子之前——人机模式下不再出现「撤了等于没撤」的尴尬。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>「重开」一键复位棋盘与胜负状态。演示和练习中都能随时重来，不必关掉窗口再打开。</Text>
